                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                    sling:resourceType="wcm/foundation/components/text"
                    text="&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ATTN: For &lt;b>GRADUATE AND CREDENTIAL STUDENT&lt;/b> leave of absence, please go to:&lt;br>&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;http://www.fullerton.edu/graduate/currentstudents/graduateforms.php&lt;br>&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(click on the link for 'Graduate Forms and Documents')&lt;/p>&#xa;"
                    textIsRich="true"/>
                <text_345184511
                    jcr:created="{Date}2020-09-08T03:12:18.852-07:00"
                    jcr:createdBy="admin"
                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2020-09-16T10:55:04.796-07:00"
                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="admin"
                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                    sling:resourceType="foundation/components/text"
                    text="&lt;p>&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;&lt;u>What does Stop-Out policy have to do with my request for a leave of absence?&lt;/u>&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xa;&amp;nbsp;Undergraduate and post-baccalaureate second bachelor's students who need to be absent from the University should&lt;b> first make use of a stop-out semester before seeking&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;to use the leave of absence&lt;/b> policy, as explained below.&lt;/p>&#xa;"
                    textIsRich="true"/>
                <text_570992252
                    jcr:created="{Date}2020-09-08T03:13:32.604-07:00"
                    jcr:createdBy="admin"
                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2020-09-16T10:55:43.849-07:00"
                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="admin"
                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                    sling:resourceType="foundation/components/text"
                    text="&lt;p>&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;IMPORTANT – ARE ALL STUDENTS ELIGIBLE FOR USING THE STOP-OUT POLICY?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; No&lt;br>&#xa; &lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;Not eligible for a stop-out semester:&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Academically disqualified students&lt;/b>&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Foreign visa students&lt;/b>&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Graduate students&lt;/b>&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Credential students&lt;/b>&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;Students who have been on an approved leave of absence for two semesters or more&lt;/b> cannot add a stop-out semester at the end of their approved leave period in an effort&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;to extend their period of absence from the university.&lt;/p>&#xa;"
                    textIsRich="true"/>
                <text_1193695889
                    jcr:created="{Date}2020-09-08T03:17:38.568-07:00"
                    jcr:createdBy="admin"
                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2020-09-16T10:55:53.103-07:00"
                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="admin"
                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                    sling:resourceType="foundation/components/text"
                    text="&lt;p>&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;&lt;u>Stop-Out Policy&lt;/u>&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xa;&lt;li>pertains to Spring and Fall semesters only (Summer Session &amp;amp; Intersession do not count as terms that are a part of the stop-out policy)&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>no form to fill out (can be non-enrolled for one semester)&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>must return to enrolled status in the semester immediately following a stop-out semester&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>registration information will be automatically available for the term following stop-out&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>can be used more than once, but not for two semesters in a row (students are not permitted to use stop-out policy for consecutive semesters)&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>cannot be used the first semester you are admitted to CSUF&lt;br>&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xa;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Example&lt;/b>: (please note: Intersession and Summer Session do not pertain to stop-out policy)&lt;/p>&#xa;"
                    textIsRich="true"/>
                <textimage
                    jcr:created="{Date}2020-09-08T03:22:15.080-07:00"
                    jcr:createdBy="admin"
                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2020-09-08T03:22:45.500-07:00"
                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="admin"
                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                    sling:resourceType="foundation/components/textimage">
                    <image
                        jcr:lastModified="{Date}2020-09-08T03:22:45.500-07:00"
                        jcr:lastModifiedBy="admin"
                        jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                        sling:resourceType="foundation/components/image"
                        fileName="LOA_Screenshot.gif">
                        <file/>
                    </image>
                </textimage>
                <text_1971480180
                    jcr:created="{Date}2020-09-08T03:23:23.629-07:00"
                    jcr:createdBy="admin"
                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2020-09-16T10:56:37.236-07:00"
                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="admin"
                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                    sling:resourceType="foundation/components/text"
                    text="&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;WARNING&lt;/b>: If the student does not enroll in the semester immediately following a stop-out semester, the student is discontinued and must apply for readmission to Cal State&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Fullerton should the student wish to return as a matriculated student.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;&lt;u>Leave of Absence Policy&lt;/u>&lt;/b> If the student has used a stop-out semester, but still needs to be absent from the university, the student can submit a request for a leave of absence&lt;b> if&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;the reason for the request is one of the circumstances listed on the leave of absence request form that follows these instructions&lt;/b>. Leave of Absence requests&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>reviewed and can either be granted or denied&lt;/b>. When submitting a leave of absence request:&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xa;&lt;li>Make sure you &lt;b>first make use of a stop-out semester&lt;/b> (if eligible to use stop-out, as explained above)&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>Make sure the&lt;b> reason for your leave request is one of the reasons listed&lt;/b> on the form&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Complete and sign&lt;/b> the 'Request for Leave of Absence' form&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Attach documentation&lt;/b> as explained below&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;&lt;u>Documentation for a Leave of Absence&lt;/u>&lt;/b> &lt;b>It is important to provide appropriate documentation for your leave of absence&lt;/b>. If your Leave of Absence request is submitted&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;without any documentation, your form will be returned to you without processing. The form can only be resubmitted when appropriate documentation is attached.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>An attached statement from the student describing the reason for requesting a leave of absence is not considered documentation.&lt;/b>&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b> Documentation must be from a source other than the student to verify the reason for the request &lt;/b>(example: letter&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>from a health care provider, military orders, study abroad contract, etc).&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xa;"
                    textIsRich="true"/>
            </responsivegrid_436751876>
